  "task": "We're upgrading the signaling system on Metro Line 7 next month which will cause multi-day closures. First, analyze recent reliability metrics and current passenger volumes to justify the project, then secure budget approval and sign the contractor agreement, and finally manage passenger communications during the closure by creating alerts, suggesting alternative routes, notifying affected users, and processing refunds for monthly pass holders."
